```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization create --help
Create a Scherzo Cloud organization

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization create [OPTIONS] --display-name <DISPLAY_NAME>

Options:
      --display-name <DISPLAY_NAME>  Set the organization display name
      --slug <SLUG>                  Request an exact organization slug
      --json                         Print the organization result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http          Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                         Print help

```
